    "body": "## Summary\n- add an admin-only payout operations console with status filtering and pagination\n- surface provider/failure metadata and immutable payout event history for operators\n- expose audited retry and final rejection actions only for `REVIEW_REQUIRED`\n- preserve backend authority for payout state transitions and wallet restoration\n- update payout documentation to match the now-funded publication flow and admin UI\n\n## Safety / accounting\n- no payout or ledger rules were moved into the browser\n- retry continues to reuse the provider idempotency contract enforced by the backend\n- final rejection still restores reserved funds through the existing idempotent `PAYOUT_RESTORE` wallet path\n- provider references remain admin-only financial metadata\n\n## Verification expected\n- web dependency audit, lint and production build\n- API/Maven verification\n- payout smoke and existing runtime/container smoke gates",
